  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 00c313ed7574a19459cb30ce651f9d5b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Jupiter.Runtime::Jupiter.World.Readable
  title: COMMAND DIRECTIVE 7 (sealed)
  body: 'AUTHORITY: Agency Director, eyes of Mission Commander only.


    PRIMARY OBJECTIVE: Conamara Chaos geophysical survey, as briefed to crew.


    SECONDARY OBJECTIVE (Directive 7): Locate the source of FEATURE 7 (Tiamat, 2171). Use orbital deep radar to map the source before landing. Return a viable biological sample to Earth in the sealed canister provided.


    Crew are not to be briefed on the secondary objective. The Commander may brief the medical officer at his discretion for sample handling.


    If the source responds to stimulus, continue. Response is not hostility.'
  setsFlag: read_sealed_orders
